   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:23,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SPINTRONICS ACT ONE
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:23,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Initial markdown output from OCR and image capture by 
