   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,106:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: One with a 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,107:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: high
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,107:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  value or one with a 
