   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,109:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  value?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,117:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,128:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//82d24b04-a4a6-4c52-92cc-5af35026dea3/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_209_990_531_1628.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A31Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcedeab7a2c067b44dcbf3c893bbea1efe04c4881140353c1f1dcaa5c25d8901a" alt="Image" width="27%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,129:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,130:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
