   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,137:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 12: LOWEST PITCH
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,139:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: MAKE THE AMMETER A1 PRODUCE THE LOWEST-PITCHED SOUND POSSIBLE WITH THE
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,140:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,144:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: NOTE: WHEN YOU SEE THE Ⓢ STAMP HERE, IT MEANS THAT YOU MUST CHECK YOUR SOLUTION IN
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,145:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: THE BACK OF THE PUZZLE BOOK.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,146:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Hold on
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,147:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: . This one is trickier than it looks.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,148:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The more resistors we have in series, the lower the sound....
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,149:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ...and we only have 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,150:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: one chain
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,151:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  to connect them all.
