   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tutorial 7: Circuit Diagrams 2
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,342:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Not too bad, right? So far, all of our circuits have just been one big loop.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,343:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Now usually people don
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,344:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,351:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: t draw the whole loop in circuit diagrams - they leave out the line that brings chain back to
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,353:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the battery. It makes diagrams simpler that way. For instance, this:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,361:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,369:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a9d7f43b-ba0c-4edd-83c9-eca63658a783/markdown_3/imgs/img_in_image_box_132_595_1030_1322.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F1f17db4082a1bd70cf5ebd1098c58754fd8da2c75eabcc138e85393253b26e59" alt="Image" width="75%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,371:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,372:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <img src="https://i.imgur.com/Y7rqfDY.png" width="3%">
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,373:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  symbol represents the 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,374:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,374:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: +
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,375:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,376:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  side
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,377:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: of the battery and the 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,378:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <img src="https://i.imgur.com/3f9GGdw.png" width="3%">
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,379:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  symbol
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,379:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: represents 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,380:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,380:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ground.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,382:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Ground is usually the place where chain returns to the battery at the 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,383:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,383:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: -
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  side.
