   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STARTING SETUP
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c6e57968-1cec-4871-8eb7-37264c8234b7/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_242_1115_693_1601.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A31Z%2F-1%2F%2F8df6b2758a02962be2fae11959818d8c7a2d48eb3e4d9d93bdb05828a768ffa7" alt="Image" width="37%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,466:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × 1000 Ω
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
