   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,672:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: I need a circuit that 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,673:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: behaves like this table
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,674:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,676:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Each row shows a combination of S1 and S2, and whether A1 should make sound.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,677:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: We need to make one circuit that works for 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,677:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: all four cases
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,678:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
