   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,765:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 21: WHERE IS THE LOWEST CURRENT?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,767:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BUILD THE CIRCUIT BELOW. THEN ADD THE AMMETER IN A WAY THAT MAKES IT PRODUCE THE 
