   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ve been using junctions to build a lot of parallel circuits, but how do we draw them in a circuit diagram? Here
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the most basic parallel circuit...
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,891:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,893:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://i.imgur.com/S5P4DY2.png" alt="Image" width="70%"
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,894:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,894:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The junction splits the green loop into 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,895:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: two parallel paths
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,900:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : a yellow path and a blue path. Those two paths each go
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,901:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: through a resistor and then rejoin the green loop again.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,903:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: So how would a simplified circuit diagram of that same circuit look? Like this...
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,906:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://i.imgur.com/YPhHqsD.png" alt="Image" width="70%"
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,910:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: As before, we can skip drawing the part where the paths connect back to the negative side of the battery. Let
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,910:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,911:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s try
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: some more...
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,913:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 25: PARALLEL AND SERIES TOGETHER
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BUILD THE FOLLOWING CIRCUIT:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,922:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
