   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,931:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ⓢ
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,932:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tricky
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,933:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: !
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:24,934:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  This circuit is a combination of both 
