   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,092:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BUILD THE FOLLOWING CIRCUIT:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,095:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
