   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,144:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <p style="text-align: center;"><b>THE SPINTRONIC CAPACITOR</b></p>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,145:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PURPOSE:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,146:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: A CAPACITOR STORES ENERGY. TURN IT TO STORE ENERGY, THEN RELEASE IT.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,147:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DETAIL:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,148:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CAPACITANCE IS MEASURED IN 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,149:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,150:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SPIN FARADS.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,150:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,151:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  THE SYMBOL FOR SPIN FARAD IS 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,152:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,153:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: F
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,155:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,156:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 31: CHARGE THE CAPACITOR
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: MAKE THE BATTERY CHARGE THE CAPACITOR.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,157:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: NOTE:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  TURN THE CAPACITOR SO BOTH HANDS POINT TO ZERO BEFORE YOU CHARGE THE
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,160:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BATTERY.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,161:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STARTING SETUP
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,169:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,177:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//af9bbd76-597e-4527-8177-11d56fe1f4ed/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_286_904_624_1488.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A36Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa2ae3b72ced05cd82fa00167a73c315d7ab8f07d4f24a00fdf9cf2144394bdd8" alt="Image" width="27%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,178:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,179:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,180:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × Chain
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,181:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,182:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × Capacitor (0.001 F)
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,183:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DIFFICULTY: ★☆☆☆☆
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,184:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 32: PUSH TO CHARGE
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,190:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BUILD A CIRCUIT THAT CHARGES THE CAPACITOR WHEN THE SWITCH IS TURNED ON. IT SHOULD
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,191:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STAY CHARGED WHEN THE SWITCH IS TURNED BACK OFF
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,194:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,195:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://i.imgur.com/sH3ZCAK.png" alt="Image" width="50%"
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,196:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,197:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The first time you turn on the switch, the 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,198:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: capacitor charges
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,199:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,200:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: After that, it just...
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,201:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stays charged
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,201:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,202:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STARTING SETUP
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,210:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,219:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//af9bbd76-597e-4527-8177-11d56fe1f4ed/markdown_3/imgs/img_in_image_box_209_931_545_1522.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A38Z%2F-1%2F%2F4637e249b87c23d25ec1b26bcb6a96084d529ec911325345fdad9b8c8fa8e986" alt="Image" width="27%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,221:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,222:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,223:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2 × Chain
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,223:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,224:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × Switch
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,225:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,226:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × Capacitor (0.001 F)
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,227:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DIFFICULTY: ★☆☆☆☆
