   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,253:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9c2dae19-aa0c-44bc-82ef-b013f79b24d6/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_301_908_637_1511.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-11T07%3A56%3A31Z%2F-1%2F%2F597021d304b443706028bd343e9544d83d92f63afe00edcc445c7ec07dc483b9" alt="Image" width="40%" /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,254:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AVAILABLE PARTS
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,255:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,256:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1 × 1000 Ω
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,257:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
