   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,263:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CHALLENGE 34: CHIRP
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,264:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BUILD A CIRCUIT THAT MAKES A SHORT SOUND WHEN S1 IS TURNED ON FOR THE FIRST TIME.
