   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,268:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://i.imgur.com/qAvFyLi.png" alt="Image" width="50%"
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,269:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,270:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STARTING SETUP
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:25,278:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
