   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,389:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <div style="text-align: center;"><img
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,391:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src="https://i.imgur.com/wyqEVjo.png" alt="Image" width="46%"
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,392:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /></div>
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,393:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Wow, that switch couples 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: three different loops
