   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  from the junction will be connected to R1.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Interesting. Both loops are going to push on R1, and since 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: both of them push with 6 V
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , the total push is...
   DEBUG: 2026-08-12 00:22:27,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STARTING SETUP
